      "string_id": "kakie_dela_s_ecologami",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Look, do you have any business with ecologists?",
      "JA_current": "Look, do you have any business with ecologists?",
      "JA_new": "なあ、エコロジストと何か取引してるのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "povar_svu_dialog_1",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:ty_o_chem#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 16,
      "string_id": "ty_o_chem",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Wha... What?! What damn ecologists?! What' ya talking about?! Scientists and Duty are our most bitter enemies! Only business we do with them is slicing them up! We... eh... You... How do you know about it anyway? Just zip it!! Or I... I'm fucked.",
      "JA_current": "Wha... What?! What damn ecologists?! What' ya talking about?! Scientists and Duty are our most bitter enemies! Only business we do with them is slicing them up! We... eh... You... How do you know about it anyway? Just zip it!! Or I... I'm fucked.",
      "JA_new": "な、何だって？エコロジストだと？何の話だ！？科学者とデューティーは俺たちの一番の敵だ！取引なんてしない。切り刻むだけさ！俺は……ええと、お前……どうしてそれを知ってる？黙ってろよ！！さもないと……俺が終わりだ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "povar_svu_dialog_1",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:sahar_rasskazal#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 19,
      "string_id": "sahar_rasskazal",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "How do I know? Sakharov dropped a word or two 'bout some drunkard... Who exchanged a really cool gun for a case of vodka.",
      "JA_current": "How do I know? Sakharov dropped a word or two 'bout some drunkard... Who exchanged a really cool gun for a case of vodka.",
      "JA_new": "どうして知ってるって？サハロフが、酔っぱらいのことを少し話してくれた。とびきりの銃とウォッカ1ケースを交換した奴のことをな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "povar_svu_dialog_1",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:moi_gromoboi#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 22,
      "string_id": "moi_gromoboi",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "My \"MOD X Gen. 3\"!.. Whe... Where is it? Did you see it?!",
      "JA_current": "My \"MOD X Gen. 3\"!.. Whe... Where is it? Did you see it?!",
      "JA_new": "俺の「MOD X Gen. 3」が！？ど、どこだ？見たのか！？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "povar_svu_dialog_1",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_military:takoi_zaebatelskiy#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_military",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_military.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 25,
      "string_id": "takoi_zaebatelskiy",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "You mean that rifle perfected for long range combat?",
      "JA_current": "You mean that rifle perfected for long range combat?",
      "JA_new": "長距離戦用に改造されたライフルのことか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "povar_svu_dialog_1",
